{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10522","headline":"和窦侍御登凉州七级浮图之作 · 高适","name":"和窦侍御登凉州七级浮图之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"化塔屹中起，孤高宜上跻。\n铁冠雄赏眺，金界宠招携。\n空色在轩户，边声连鼓鼙。\n天寒万里北，地豁九州西。\n清兴揖才彦，峻风和端倪。\n始知阳春後，具物皆筌蹄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10522.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10522","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}